   architecture.md §5 renders the *whole* desired config, not a patch onto
   whatever master.cf happened to contain before (deterministic, no
   drift). Standard service stanzas below are Postfix's own package
   defaults; only the `smtp` and `submission` entries carry
   relay-specific overrides — see docs/postfix-architecture.md §3. #}
#
# service type  private unpriv  chroot  wakeup  maxproc command + args
#               (yes)   (yes)   (no)    (never) (100)
